{"id":"wb-6-309","name":"醇亲王府","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"醇亲王府","text":"醇亲王府是大清醇亲王的府邸，位于今北京市西城区什刹海街道后海北沿44号。\n醇亲王府原在今复兴门南的原太平湖旧址，也称“南府”、“太平湖醇亲王府”。因光绪帝出生于此，故成为“潜龙邸”。\n光绪帝登基后，清廷遂在后海给醇亲王建造一个新的醇亲王府，也称“北府”、“后海醇亲王府”。1908年，醇亲王载沣之子溥仪继承大统后，此处醇亲王府亦成为“潜龙邸”。\n随后清廷为此建造第三座醇亲王府，即监国摄政王府。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%86%87%E4%BA%B2%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%9C","revisionId":94328106,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94328106","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/09cfeb726e59701d02d7c25a.jpg","title":"Wangfudamen.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wangfudamen.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1c/Wangfudamen.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"原上传者为中文維基百科的用心阁","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​王府大门。","width":320,"height":240}}